          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.0001286541938750507,
          "sentence": "4. The paper presents a few ablation studies that provide insights into how much different components of the model, such as incorporating biases into word embeddings and incorporating attention from conclusion to supplement, contribute to performance improvement.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
