        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00005020698561916834,
          "sentence": "4. The paper says that current systems designed for non-factoid QA cannot generalize to questions outside those stored in QA sites and claims that this is one of the contributions of this paper.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
