        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00011880405385986161,
          "sentence": "5. For human evaluation, were the outputs of the proposed model and those of the QA-LSTM model each judged by both human experts, or did one human expert judge the outputs of one system and the other human expert judge the outputs of the other system?",
