        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006479131359602133,
          "sentence": "6. I wonder why the authors did not do a human evaluation where they simply ask human workers, not experts, to compare the output of the proposed model with that of the QA-LSTM model: which of the two outputs would they like to hear when asking for advice?",
