          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.0001538028337883974,
          "sentence": "For example, for the first example, the output of the QA-LSTM says, “You should wait until you feel excited,” whereas the output of the proposed model says, “It is better to concentrate on how to confess your love to her,” which seems a bit indirect in relation to the question asked.",
